        <obo:IAO_0000115>S present_in_taxon T if some instance of T has some S. This does not means that all instances of T have an S - it may only be certain life stages or sexes that have S</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>S present_in_taxon T if some instance of T has some S. This does not means that all instances of T have an S - it may only be certain life stages or sexes that have S.</obo:IAO_0000115>
