        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_52217"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any substance which when absorbed into a living organism may modify one or more of its functions. The term is generally accepted for a substance taken for a therapeutic purpose, but is also commonly used for abused substances.</obo:IAO_0000115>
