        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35352"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An amino acid that is phenylacetic acid which is substituted at position 2 by the nitrogen of 2-chloro-6-fluoroaniline and at position 5 by a methyl group. A highly selective cyclooxygenase 2 inhibitor, it was briefly used for the treatment of osteoarthritis, but was withdrawn due to concersns of hepatotoxicity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
