        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_67135"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Cell component which has as its direct parts a portion of cytosol and one or more organelles. Examples: cytoplasm of hepatocyte, cytoplasm of erythrocyte, cytoplasm of thrombocyte, cytoplasm of neuron.</obo:IAO_0000115>
