        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0006810"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The directed movement of phospholipids into, out of or within a cell, or between cells, by means of some agent such as a transporter or pore. Phospholipids are any lipids containing phosphoric acid as a mono- or diester.</obo:IAO_0000115>
