        <rdfs:comment>Neurofibrillary tangles have been found in aging population; their formation is increased in Alzheimer&apos;s disease patients (and in other neurological diseases) compared to normal controls (see PMID:848276 and PMID:8584267).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>neurofibrillary tangle assembly</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


