        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000648"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>They are a group of drugs that block the normal breakdown of acetylcholine (ACh) into acetate and choline and thereby increase both the levels and duration of actions of acetylcholine found in the central and peripheral nervous system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
