        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The second version of California Verbal Learning Test, a neuropsychological test developed to make a comprehensive and detailed assessment of verbal learning and memory in individuals ranging in age from 16 to 89 years.</obo:IAO_0000115>
