        <obo:NCIT_P207>C0023981</obo:NCIT_P207>
        <obo:NCIT_P322>CDISC</obo:NCIT_P322>
        <obo:NCIT_P322>CDISC-GLOSS</obo:NCIT_P322>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>In medicine, a study or clinical trial in which participants are identified and then followed forward in time.</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>Investigation in which data are collected from a number of subjects over a long period of time (a well-known example is the Framingham study).</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>Studies that look forward using periodic observations collected predominantly following subject enrollment. (clinicaltrials.gov)</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P366>Longitudinal_Study</obo:NCIT_P366>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Longitudinal Study</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
