        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C16518"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A protein which binds to enhancers having a conserved CCAAT sequence. CCAAT enhancer binding proteins are a subclass of bZIP transcription factors that bind the CCAAT DNA sequence as homo- or heterodimers with other family members, C/EBP-alpha, beta, gamma, delta, epsilon. They include both transcriptional activators and repressors, and some are involved in myelopoiesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
