        <obo:IAO_0000115>Specific metabolic changes that characterize an organism&apos;s state of health or disease, or response to a particular therapeutic intervention, and helps make diagnosis more accurate or enable physicians to make diagnosis before symptoms appear and to track disease progression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
