        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23924"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any substance that inhibits protein farnesyltransferase, an enzyme that catalyzes the transfer of a farnesyl moiety from farnesyl pyrophosphate to a cysteine. Protein farnesyltransferase is involved in Ras-mediated post-translational modification. Inhibition of protein farnesyltransferase may inhibit the oncogenic activity of Ras.</obo:IAO_0000115>
