        <obo:NCIT_P98>Neurotrophin signaling is mediated by the Trk family of receptor tyrosine kinases. (IP, N. Y. (1998), The Neurotrophins and Neuropoietic Cytokines: Two Families of Growth Factors Acting on Neural and Hematopoietic Cells. Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences, 840: 97-106. doi: 10.1111/j.1749-6632.1998.tb09553.x)</obo:NCIT_P98>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Neurotrophic Factor</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
