    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C41189 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C41189">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500000"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A matter or an individual that is observed, analyzed, examined, investigated, experimented upon, or/and treated in the course of a particular study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ncit.owl"/>
        <obo:NCIT_NHC0>C41189</obo:NCIT_NHC0>
        <obo:NCIT_P106>Functional Concept</obo:NCIT_P106>
        <obo:NCIT_P107>Study Subject</obo:NCIT_P107>
        <obo:NCIT_P108>Study Subject</obo:NCIT_P108>
        <obo:NCIT_P207>C0681850</obo:NCIT_P207>
        <obo:NCIT_P322>BRIDG</obo:NCIT_P322>
        <obo:NCIT_P322>CDISC</obo:NCIT_P322>
        <obo:NCIT_P322>CTRP</obo:NCIT_P322>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>A physical entity which is the primary unit of operational and/or administrative interest in a study.   EXAMPLE(S): A person who is registered in a study as a recipient of an investigational product or as a control.   Individuals who are being screened for studies.  Individuals participating in observational or other studies.    A pacemaker, a fuse that can be used in medical devices, a cow, a pen of pigs, or a tissue sample from a tissue bank.  OTHER NAME(S):  NOTE(S): StudySubjects within a study are all of the same type.  An entity registered in a study is not part of another entity registered in the same study.</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>A physical entity which is the primary unit of operational and/or administrative interest in a study. EXAMPLE(S): A person who is registered in a study as a recipient of an investigational product or as a control. Individuals who are being screened for studies. Individuals participating in observational or other studies. A pacemaker, a fuse that can be used in medical devices, a cow, a farm, a pen of pigs, or a tissue sample from a tissue bank. NOTE(S): StudySubjects within a study are all of the same type. An entity registered in a study is not part of another entity registered in the same study.</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P325>An individual who is observed, analyzed, examined, investigated, experimented upon, or/and treated in the course of a particular study.</obo:NCIT_P325>
        <obo:NCIT_P366>Study_Subject</obo:NCIT_P366>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>STUDY SUBJECT</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Study Participant</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Study Subject</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>StudySubject</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Subject</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
