        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A gene is a material entity that represents the entire DNA sequence required for synthesis of a functional protein or RNA molecule. </obo:IAO_0000115>
