        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>segment of cerebral cortex</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>UBERON:0016526</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>We use the term lobe broadly as a rough regional area, encompassing homologous regions in smooth-brained mammals. We subdivide the lobes into white matter and neocortical parts.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>lobe of cerebral hemisphere</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


